SUMMARY:The World as Your Canvas: Introduction to AR
DESCRIPTION:This session introduces participants to the practical power of Augmented Reality (AR) and its rapidly expanding role in our lives. It explores how AR overlays digital information onto the physical world. Participants engage in hands-on exercises with user-friendly accessible mobile AR tools\, learning to integrate digital utility into their surroundings and gaining a clear understanding of how this technology enhances how we live\, work\, and perceive the world around us.
LOCATION:Idea Lab - Level 5\, Immersive Lab
